<div class="prose prose-slate">
  <div class="border-b border-gray-200 mb-6">
    <h1>Listbox</h1>
  </div>

  <p>
    A single-select value picker with keyboard navigation, intelligent positioning, and Phoenix form integration.
    Use a listbox when users need to select one value from a predefined set of options.
  </p>

  <p>
    Unlike <code>Dropdown</code>, which provides an action menu with <code>role="menu"</code>,
    <code>Listbox</code>
    uses <code>role="listbox"</code>
    and works like a native <code>&lt;select&gt;</code>. It includes smart positioning with <a
      href="https://floating-ui.com/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800"
    >
      Floating UI
    </a>, and its options match the trigger's width by default.
  </p>

  <h2>Quick Start</h2>
  <p>
    The most basic listbox requires three components: <code>.listbox</code>, <code>.listbox_trigger</code>, and
    <code>.listbox_options</code>
    with <code>.listbox_option</code>
    elements.
  </p>

  <div class="not-prose">
    <.code_example file="listbox/basic.html.heex" id="basic-listbox-demo" />
  </div>

  <p>
    This example starts with "Cherry" selected through the <code>value</code>
    attribute. Selecting another option updates the <code>.listbox_value</code>
    content immediately.
  </p>

  <h2>Form Integration</h2>
  <p>
    <code>.listbox</code>
    renders a hidden <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>
    with the given <code>name</code>. Selecting an option updates the input and dispatches an
    <code>input</code>
    event. This makes a parent form's <code>phx-change</code>
    event run as it does for a native form field.
    Use <code>.listbox_value</code>
    to render the current value or a placeholder in the trigger.
  </p>

  <div class="not-prose">
    <.code_example
      file="listbox/listbox_form_demo.ex"
      module={DemoWeb.DemoLive.ListboxFormDemo}
      id="listbox-form-demo"
    />
  </div>

  <p>
    The selected fruit below the trigger comes from server state. It confirms that the
    <code>phx-change</code>
    event completed while the trigger value updated immediately.
  </p>

  <h2>Disabled Options</h2>
  <p>
    Disable a listbox option with the <code>disabled={true}</code>
    attribute. Disabled options cannot receive focus or be selected.
  </p>

  <div class="not-prose">
    <.code_example file="listbox/disabled.html.heex" id="disabled-listbox-demo" />
  </div>

  <h2>Keyboard Interaction</h2>
  <p>
    The listbox provides keyboard navigation that follows standard ARIA patterns.
    Use the arrow keys to move between options and Enter or Space to select an option.
  </p>

  <div class="not-prose my-6">
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
      <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200">
        <thead class="bg-gray-50">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Key
            </th>
            <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Description
            </th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200">
          <tr>
            <td
              colspan="2"
              class="px-6 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50 border-b border-indigo-100"
            >
              When the trigger button is focused:
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-mono text-gray-900">
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                Enter
              </kbd>
              <span class="text-gray-400 mx-1">/</span>
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                Space
              </kbd>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-gray-700">
              Opens the listbox and focuses the current selection (or the first option, if none)
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-mono text-gray-900">
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                ↓
              </kbd>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-gray-700">
              Opens the listbox and focuses the first non-disabled option
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-mono text-gray-900">
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                ↑
              </kbd>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-gray-700">
              Opens the listbox and focuses the last non-disabled option
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td
              colspan="2"
              class="px-6 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50 border-b border-indigo-100"
            >
              When the listbox is open:
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-mono text-gray-900">
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                Esc
              </kbd>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-gray-700">
              Closes the listbox without changing the selection, and returns focus to the trigger
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-mono text-gray-900">
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                ↑
              </kbd>
              <span class="text-gray-400 mx-1">/</span>
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                ↓
              </kbd>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-gray-700">
              Focuses the previous/next non-disabled option (wraps around)
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-mono text-gray-900">
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                Home
              </kbd>
              <span class="text-gray-400 mx-1">/</span>
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                End
              </kbd>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-gray-700">
              Focuses the first/last non-disabled option
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-mono text-gray-900">
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                Enter
              </kbd>
              <span class="text-gray-400 mx-1">/</span>
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                Space
              </kbd>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-gray-700">
              Selects the focused option, updates the displayed value, and closes the listbox
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-mono text-gray-900">
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                A-Z
              </kbd>
              <span class="text-gray-400 mx-1">/</span>
              <kbd class="px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm font-semibold">
                0-9
              </kbd>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-gray-700">
              Focuses the first option that starts with the typed character. Repeated presses cycle through matching options.
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
